{"id":"6e0c4adbcbd633be","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions.md","title":"空量词块给出的普通层级包含","display":"lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions — 空量词块给出的普通层级包含","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions","aliases":["72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions"],"display":"lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions — 空量词块给出的普通层级包含","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II Definition1.2.1, print83/PDF95; local syntax induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions — 空量词块给出的普通层级包含"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44d76667d32d9bbd\" href=\"?note=44d76667d32d9bbd\" title=\"72-df-first-order-induction-fragments\">72-df-first-order-induction-fragments</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II Definition1.2.1, print83/PDF95; local syntax induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>所有层级和系统取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44d76667d32d9bbd\" href=\"?note=44d76667d32d9bbd\" title=\"72-df-first-order-induction-fragments\">72-df-first-order-induction-fragments</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为其固定经典一阶含等式演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a\\cup\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a\\subseteq\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}^a\\cap\\mathsf\\Pi_{n+1}^a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a\\cup\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a\\subseteq\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}^a\\cap\\mathsf\\Pi_{n+1}^a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0=I\\mathsf\\Sigma_0=I\\mathsf\\Pi_0,\\qquad\nI\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\\cup I\\mathsf\\Pi_n\\subseteq I\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\cap I\\mathsf\\Pi_{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\Delta_0=I\\mathsf\\Sigma_0=I\\mathsf\\Pi_0,\\qquad\nI\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\\cup I\\mathsf\\Pi_n\\subseteq I\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\cap I\\mathsf\\Pi_{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>n=0 由允许空前缀直接成立。归纳时，Σₙ 是存在块接 Πₙ₋₁，归纳包含使矩阵进入 Πₙ，因此仍是 Σₙ₊₁；同类包含及空前缀再给交叉包含。Π 情形对偶。将语法包含代入相同的 IND 构造便得到字面的公理集合包含。没有声称严格包含或将这些弱包含视为深层分离定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-induction-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"44d76667d32d9bbd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-induction-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"44d76667d32d9bbd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"所有层级和系统取 [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]]；$n\\in\\omega$，$\\vdash$ 为其固定经典一阶含等式演算。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a\\cup\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a\\subseteq\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}^a\\cap\\mathsf\\Pi_{n+1}^a.","display":true},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0=I\\mathsf\\Sigma_0=I\\mathsf\\Pi_0,\\qquad\nI\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\\cup I\\mathsf\\Pi_n\\subseteq I\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\cap I\\mathsf\\Pi_{n+1}.","display":true}],"bytes":1626,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] · [[72-thm-arithmetic-induction-collection-chain]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] · [[72-thm-arithmetic-induction-collection-chain]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-495","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] · [[72-thm-arithmetic-induction-collection-chain]]"}],"outgoing